    <td class="ellipsisize">
              Historical Map &amp; Chart Collection of NOAA's Nautical Charts, Hydrographic Surveys, Topographic Surveys, Geodetic Surveys, City Plans, and Civil War Battle Maps Starting from the mid 1700's
          </td>
  </tr>
                    <tr>
